        ],
        "stays": [
          "p2426 42055 - 24120 against p2535 42055 - 55615"
        ],
        "note": "motor-driven; there's no steering: the tracks can't run against each other"
      },
      {
        "does": "With the red lever at the back of the upper works in the middle (N), the black gear behind it, used as a knob, swings the discharge belt round on its own turntable, so it can be aimed over the mine truck: its shaft runs forward through two universal joints and bevel gears to a 12 tooth gear on the turntable.",
        "source": "book: page 545, function D; page 544 (D labelled); inferred from the model: the gear train from p1714 to p1616",
        "control": "p1714 32269",
        "moves": [
          "p1616 32270",
